	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nSKYGiURcNyiWSyC8",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 1, DX 12, IQ 3, HT 9, HP 1, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 9, SPEED 5.25, MOVE 2, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "ntumdMwpQ4GfQ9Lha",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 1 (offense -7, protection -11), threat tier minor, appearing 6."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4O26XRTBTB-O-rSq",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/sea-horse.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "na4WHQ9FbvQXRY3_G",
			"text": "Independent build total: -170 points of racial traits plus 1 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4na4a_6YIVbJj6se",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Sea Horse (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nOhzTinAoWIRmxzdz",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "n10heugNkTZ0OQDRM",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 0.02 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nJd4utDEWiNW3WHdu",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 2; water Move 2 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "n55Xn5HDBP2DfxLC6",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
